===

[Fund it by grant]: The library should be funded by a council grant.
    <+ [A grant reaches everyone]: A grant keeps the library open to everyone.
        {about: {option: grant, reach: everyone}}
    <+ [A grant costs little]: A grant costs the council little.
        {about: {option: grant, cost: low}}
    <+ [A fee reaches members only]: A fee keeps out all but members, and the council pays for collecting it.
        {about: [{option: fee, reach: members}, {option: fee, cost: high}]}
    <+ [Shorter hours cut visits]: Visits fell because the library opened for fewer hours.
        <+ [Visits fell on the closed evenings]: Visits fell most on the evenings it closed early.
    <- [Reading moved online]: Visits fell because people read online instead. #reported
        <- [Visits fell on the closed evenings]
